cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Spectral structure of approximate one-form symmetry breaking"
abstract: >-
  Conditional on a positive Stieltjes representation of the gauge-invariant
  static response, the reduced one-form symmetry-breaking profile is the
  Laplace transform of a positive measure whose support edge is the lowest
  threshold coupled to the observable. Includes an adversarial priority audit, a per-claim
  novelty matrix, and an adversarial falsification suite.
authors:
